      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Who among us\u2026\n\n\nPolymarket (@Polymarket)\n\nJUST IN: It's been revealed that a top FEMA official claimed he was involuntarily teleported to a Waffle House.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/Polymarket/status/2036096549113971089#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2036107410033533197",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-23T15:46:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\ud83d\udc40\n\n\nBonchie (@bonchieredstate)\n\nYou know, I don\u2019t remember this standard of infallibility endowed by military service being given to John McCain, Dan Crenshaw, etc.\n\nThat\u2019s because it doesn\u2019t exist. Meritorious service doesn\u2019t place someone above criticism in other arenas.\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/bonchieredstate/status/2035763958469046673#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2035860136950981080",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-22T23:24:15+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "For the love of God - leave Erika Kirk alone. She has experienced enough pain for several lifetimes already.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2035492634064568446",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-21T23:03:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Why is there so much shit in this man\u2019s office. How do you not feel claustrophobic in there?!\n\n\nNiles Francis (@NilesGApol)\n\nCNN is letting Tapper doing his show live from his office today and it is truly one of the weirdest live news broadcasts I\u2019ve seen in a long time\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/NilesGApol/status/2035100878936416705#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2035333326349664717",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-21T12:30:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Return from maternity leave the 30th! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\u2665\ufe0f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\n\n\nSalmonBayGay (@SalmonBayGay)\n\nKevin is @MeghanMcCain coming back to @2waytvapp ?\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/SalmonBayGay/status/2035079462275228107#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2035112361883734331",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-20T21:52:52+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I love this! \ud83c\udf52\n\n\nJennifer Jacobs (@JenniferJJacobs)\n\nJapan will gift another 250 cherry blossom trees to Washington, DC to celebrate America 250, @JPN_PMO Sanae Takaichi says at White House\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/JenniferJJacobs/status/2034776458871083481#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2034799696363876594",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-20T01:10:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
